# ─── PUBLISHER CONTENT. NEVER COMMIT. ──────────────────────────────────────
# The manuscript states "Publisher full texts are not redistributed". These are
# copyrighted articles and supplements downloaded for curation. The truth set
# records a verbatim quotation and a PMID from each, which is what a reader
# needs; the PDFs themselves are not ours to publish.
data/papers/
docs/sources/*.pdf

# ─── THIRD-PARTY REFERENCE DATA, large and re-downloadable ─────────────────
whole_genome_SNVs.tsv.gz.tbi
data/raw/hg38*
*.fa
*.fa.gz
*.fai

# ─── CREDENTIALS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The AlphaGenome key lives at ~/.alphagenome/api_key, outside this tree.
*api_key*
.env
*.pem
*.key

# ─── LOCAL CLUTTER ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
~$*

# ─── RESUME CHECKPOINTS, not evidence ──────────────────────────────────────
# 06_score_atlas.py writes one file per 32 bp request so a long run can resume.
# The consolidated results/atlas_locus_PKD1.tsv.gz (156,574 rows) and
# atlas_locus_PKD2.tsv.gz (225,577 rows) contain every scored position, so the
# 3,981 chunk files add 16 MB and verify nothing the locus files do not.
results/atlas_chunks/
